function Deliveries({profile}:{profile:Profile}){const[rows,setRows]=useState<any[]>([]),[orders,setOrders]=useState<any[]>([]),[open,setOpen]=useState(false),[order,setOrder]=useState(""),[datev,setDatev]=useState(""),[time,setTime]=useState(""),[obs,setObs]=useState(""),[error,setError]=useState("");async function load(){const[a,b]=await Promise.all([sb.from("deliveries").select("*,orders(code,clients(company_name,name))").order("created_at",{ascending:false}),sb.from("orders").select("id,code").neq("status","entregado")]);if(a.error)setError(friendly(a.error));else setRows(a.data||[]);if(!b.error)setOrders(b.data||[])}useEffect(()=>{load()},[]);const canCreate=profile.role?.name==="administrador";async function save(){const{data:{user}}=await sb.auth.getUser();const{error}=await sb.from("deliveries").insert({order_id:order,delivery_date:datev||null,delivery_time:time||null,observation:obs,status:"pendiente",responsible_id:user?.id,created_by:user?.id});if(error)setError(friendly(error));else{setOpen(false);load()}}async function change(id:string,status:string){const{error}=await sb.from("deliveries").update({status}).eq("id",id);if(error)setError(friendly(error));else load()}return <><Head title="Entregas" description="Preparación, entrega y confirmación de pedidos." onNew={canCreate?()=>setOpen(true):undefined} onRefresh={load}/><div className="panel"><div className="tablewrap"><table className="table"><thead><tr><th>Pedido</th><th>Cliente</th><th>Fecha</th><th>Estado</th></tr></thead><tbody>{rows.map(r=><tr key={r.id}><td>{r.orders?.code}</td><td>{r.orders?.clients?.company_name||r.orders?.clients?.name}</td><td>{day(r.delivery_date)} {r.delivery_time||""}</td><td><select className="compact" value={r.status} onChange={e=>change(r.id,e.target.value)} disabled={!canCreate}><option>pendiente</option><option>preparado</option><option>entregado</option></select></td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></div>{error&&<div className="error">{error}</div>}{open&&<Modal title="Nueva entrega" onClose={()=>setOpen(false)}><div className="formgrid"><Field label="Pedido"><select value={order} onChange={e=>setOrder(e.target.value)}><option value="">Seleccionar…</option>{orders.map(o=><option key={o.id} value={o.id}>{o.code}</option>)}</select></Field><Field label="Fecha"><input type="date" value={datev} onChange={e=>setDatev(e.target.value)}/></Field><Field label="Hora"><input type="time" value={time} onChange={e=>setTime(e.target.value)}/></Field><Field label="Observación" wide><textarea rows={3} value={obs} onChange={e=>setObs(e.target.value)}/></Field></div><div className="modalfoot"><Btn secondary onClick={()=>setOpen(false)}>Cancelar</Btn><Btn disabled={!order} onClick={save}>Guardar entrega</Btn></div></Modal>}</>}
function Cash({profile}:{profile:Profile}){const[reg,setReg]=useState<any>(null),[rows,setRows]=useState<any[]>([]),[amount,setAmount]=useState(""),[type,setType]=useState("ingreso"),[concept,setConcept]=useState(""),[method,setMethod]=useState("efectivo"),[error,setError]=useState("");async function load(){const[a,b]=await Promise.all([sb.from("cash_registers").select("*").eq("seller_id",profile.id).eq("status","abierta").maybeSingle(),sb.from("cash_movements").select("*").eq("created_by",profile.id).order("created_at",{ascending:false})]);setReg(a.data);if(b.error)setError(friendly(b.error));else setRows(b.data||[])}useEffect(()=>{load()},[]);const balance=Number(reg?.opening_amount||0)+rows.reduce((n,r)=>n+(r.type==="ingreso"?Number(r.amount):-Number(r.amount)),0);async function openCash(){const{error}=await sb.from("cash_registers").insert({seller_id:profile.id,opening_amount:Number(amount||0)});if(error)setError(friendly(error));else{setAmount("");load()}}async function move(){const{error}=await sb.from("cash_movements").insert({register_id:reg.id,type,concept,amount:Number(amount),payment_method:method,created_by:profile.id});if(error)setError(friendly(error));else{setAmount("");setConcept("");load()}}async function closeCash(){const counted=prompt("Arqueo final (Gs.):");if(counted===null)return;const{error}=await sb.from("cash_registers").update({status:"cerrada",closed_at:new Date().toISOString(),counted_amount:Number(counted)}).eq("id",reg.id);if(error)setError(friendly(error));else load()}return <><Head title="Caja" description="Caja por vendedor, movimientos, cierre y arqueo." onRefresh={load}/>{!reg?<div className="panel"><h3>Abrir caja</h3><Field label="Monto inicial (Gs.)"><input type="number" min="0" value={amount} onChange={e=>setAmount(e.target.value)}/></Field><Btn onClick={openCash}>Abrir caja</Btn></div>:<><div className="grid three"><div className="card"><div className="kicker">Saldo</div><div className="metric">{money(balance)}</div></div><div className="card"><div className="kicker">Apertura</div><div className="metric">{money(reg.opening_amount)}</div></div><div className="card"><div className="kicker">Estado</div><div className="metric">Abierta</div></div></div><div className="panel"><div className="subhead"><h3>Movimiento</h3><Btn secondary onClick={closeCash}>Cerrar / arqueo</Btn></div><div className="formgrid"><Field label="Tipo"><select value={type} onChange={e=>setType(e.target.value)}><option>ingreso</option><option>egreso</option></select></Field><Field label="Monto"><input type="number" min="0" value={amount} onChange={e=>setAmount(e.target.value)}/></Field><Field label="Método"><select value={method} onChange={e=>setMethod(e.target.value)}>{["efectivo","transferencia","tarjeta","qr","otro"].map(x=><option key={x}>{x}</option>)}</select></Field><Field label="Concepto"><input value={concept} onChange={e=>setConcept(e.target.value)}/></Field></div><Btn disabled={!amount||!concept} onClick={move}>Registrar movimiento</Btn></div><div className="panel"><div className="tablewrap"><table className="table"><thead><tr><th>Fecha</th><th>Tipo</th><th>Concepto</th><th>Método</th><th>Monto</th></tr></thead><tbody>{rows.map(r=><tr key={r.id}><td>{day(r.created_at)}</td><td><Status>{r.type}</Status></td><td>{r.concept}</td><td>{r.payment_method||"—"}</td><td>{money(r.amount)}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></div></>}{error&&<div className="error">{error}</div>}</>}
function Reports(){const[from,setFrom]=useState(""),[to,setTo]=useState(""),[d,setD]=useState<any>({sales:[],quotes:[],payments:[],orders:[],clients:[]}),[error,setError]=useState("");async function load(){const range=(q:any)=>{let x=q;if(from)x=x.gte("created_at",from);if(to)x=x.lte("created_at",`${to}T23:59:59`);return x};const[s,q,p,o,c]=await Promise.all([range(sb.from("sales").select("total,balance,created_at")),range(sb.from("quotes").select("total,status,created_at")),range(sb.from("payments").select("amount,created_at")),sb.from("orders").select("status,priority"),sb.from("clients").select("active")]);if([s,q,p,o,c].some(x=>x.error))setError("No se pudieron cargar todos los indicadores.");setD({sales:s.data||[],quotes:q.data||[],payments:p.data||[],orders:o.data||[],clients:c.data||[]})}useEffect(()=>{load()},[]);const sales=d.sales.reduce((n:number,r:any)=>n+Number(r.total||0),0),paid=d.payments.reduce((n:number,r:any)=>n+Number(r.amount||0),0);return <><Head title="Reportes" description="Indicadores con filtro por período." onRefresh={load}/><div className="panel"><div className="formgrid"><Field label="Desde"><input type="date" value={from} onChange={e=>setFrom(e.target.value)}/></Field><Field label="Hasta"><input type="date" value={to} onChange={e=>setTo(e.target.value)}/></Field></div><Btn onClick={load}>Aplicar filtros</Btn></div><div className="grid"><div className="card"><div className="kicker">Ventas</div><div className="metric">{money(sales)}</div></div><div className="card"><div className="kicker">Cobros</div><div className="metric">{money(paid)}</div></div><div className="card"><div className="kicker">Pedidos pendientes</div><div className="metric">{d.orders.filter((x:any)=>!['entregado','cancelado'].includes(x.status)).length}</div></div><div className="card"><div className="kicker">Clientes activos</div><div className="metric">{d.clients.filter((x:any)=>x.active).length}</div></div></div><div className="grid three"><div className="panel"><h3>Presupuestos</h3>{["borrador","enviado","modificacion","aprobado","rechazado","vencido"].map(x=><p className="reportrow" key={x}><span>{x}</span><strong>{d.quotes.filter((q:any)=>q.status===x).length}</strong></p>)}</div><div className="panel"><h3>Ventas</h3><p className="reportrow"><span>Con saldo</span><strong>{d.sales.filter((s:any)=>Number(s.balance)>0).length}</strong></p><p className="reportrow"><span>Pagadas</span><strong>{d.sales.filter((s:any)=>Number(s.balance)<=0).length}</strong></p></div><div className="panel"><h3>Prioridades</h3>{["normal","alta","urgente"].map(x=><p className="reportrow" key={x}><span>{x}</span><strong>{d.orders.filter((o:any)=>o.priority===x).length}</strong></p>)}</div></div>{error&&<div className="error">{error}</div>}</>}
function QrReader(){const[code,setCode]=useState(new URLSearchParams(location.search).get("code")||""),[data,setData]=useState<any>(null),[error,setError]=useState(""),[scan,setScan]=useState(false);async function lookup(v=code){setData(null);setError("");const x=v.trim().toUpperCase();const table=x.startsWith("PRE-")?"quotes":x.startsWith("VENT-")?"sales":x.startsWith("PED-")?"orders":"";if(!table){setError("Código no reconocido.");return}const{data,error}=await sb.from(table).select("*").or(`code.eq.${x},number.eq.${x}`).maybeSingle();if(error||!data)setError("No se encontró el registro o no tienes acceso.");else setData({table,row:data})}async function camera(){setScan(true);try{const{Html5Qrcode}=await import("html5-qrcode");const qr=new Html5Qrcode("qr-reader");await qr.start({facingMode:"environment"},{fps:10,qrbox:220},async s=>{setCode(s);await qr.stop();setScan(false);lookup(s)},()=>{})}catch{setScan(false);setError("No fue posible iniciar la cámara. Usa el código manual.")}}return <><Head title="Lector QR" description="Consulta segura de presupuestos, ventas y pedidos."/><div className="qrbox"><Field label="Código"><input value={code} onChange={e=>setCode(e.target.value.toUpperCase())}/></Field><div className="actions"><Btn onClick={()=>lookup()}><Search size={16}/>Consultar</Btn><Btn secondary onClick={camera}><Camera size={16}/>Cámara</Btn></div><div id="qr-reader" className="scanner">{!scan&&<div className="scannerhint"><QrCode size={34}/><span>Escáner QR</span></div>}</div>{error&&<div className="error">{error}</div>}{data&&<div className="panel"><h3>{data.row.code}</h3><p>Estado: <Status>{data.row.status||data.row.payment_status}</Status></p><p>Total: <strong>{money(data.row.total)}</strong></p>{data.row.balance!=null&&<p>Saldo: <strong>{money(data.row.balance)}</strong></p>}</div>}</div></>}
function Users(){const[rows,setRows]=useState<any[]>([]),[roles,setRoles]=useState<any[]>([]),[open,setOpen]=useState(false),[name,setName]=useState(""),[email,setEmail]=useState(""),[role,setRole]=useState(""),[error,setError]=useState("");async function load(){const[a,b]=await Promise.all([sb.from("profiles").select("*,role:roles(name)").order("created_at",{ascending:false}),sb.from("roles").select("id,name").order("name")]);if(a.error)setError(friendly(a.error));else setRows(a.data||[]);if(!b.error)setRoles(b.data||[])}useEffect(()=>{load()},[]);async function invoke(body:any){const{data,error}=await sb.functions.invoke("admin-users",{body});if(error||data?.error)setError(friendly(error||data?.error));else load()}return <><Head title="Usuarios" description="Invitaciones, roles y activación. Las contraseñas nunca son visibles." onNew={()=>setOpen(true)} onRefresh={load}/><div className="panel"><div className="tablewrap"><table className="table"><thead><tr><th>Usuario</th><th>Rol</th><th>Estado</th><th/></tr></thead><tbody>{rows.map(r=><tr key={r.id}><td><strong>{r.full_name||"Sin nombre"}</strong><br/><span className="muted">{r.email}</span></td><td><select className="compact" value={r.role_id||""} onChange={e=>invoke({action:"set_role",user_id:r.id,value:e.target.value})}>{roles.map(x=><option key={x.id} value={x.id}>{roleNames[x.name]||x.name}</option>)}</select></td><td><Status>{r.status}</Status></td><td><Btn secondary onClick={()=>invoke({action:"set_status",user_id:r.id,value:r.status==='activo'?'inactivo':'activo'})}>{r.status==='activo'?"Desactivar":"Activar"}</Btn></td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></div>{error&&<div className="error">{error}</div>}{open&&<Modal title="Invitar usuario" onClose={()=>setOpen(false)}><div className="formgrid"><Field label="Nombre"><input value={name} onChange={e=>setName(e.target.value)}/></Field><Field label="Correo"><input type="email" value={email} onChange={e=>setEmail(e.target.value)}/></Field><Field label="Rol"><select value={role} onChange={e=>setRole(e.target.value)}><option value="">Seleccionar…</option>{roles.map(x=><option key={x.id} value={x.id}>{roleNames[x.name]||x.name}</option>)}</select></Field></div><p className="muted small">El usuario recibirá una invitación y definirá su propia contraseña.</p><div className="modalfoot"><Btn secondary onClick={()=>setOpen(false)}>Cancelar</Btn><Btn disabled={!name||!email||!role} onClick={()=>invoke({action:"create",email,full_name:name,role_id:role}).then(()=>setOpen(false))}>Enviar invitación</Btn></div></Modal>}</>}
function Settings(){const[company,setCompany]=useState<any>({});const[error,setError]=useState("");useEffect(()=>{(async()=>{const{data,error}=await sb.from("system_settings").select("*").order("key");if(error)setError(friendly(error));else setCompany(data?.find(x=>x.key==='company')?.value||{})})()},[]);async function save(){const{data:{user}}=await sb.auth.getUser();const{error}=await sb.from("system_settings").upsert({key:"company",value:company,updated_by:user?.id,updated_at:new Date().toISOString()},{onConflict:"key"});if(error)setError(friendly(error));else setError("")}return <><Head title="Configuración" description="Parámetros centrales, PYG, IVA y datos corporativos."/><div className="panel"><h3>Parámetros</h3><div className="settinggrid"><div className="setting"><strong>Moneda</strong><span>PYG / Gs.</span></div><div className="setting"><strong>IVA</strong><span>10%</span></div><div className="setting"><strong>Catálogo</strong><span>Precios sin IVA</span></div></div></div><div className="panel"><h3>Datos corporativos</h3><div className="formgrid">{[["Nombre comercial","brand"],["Razón social","name"],["RUC","ruc"],["Teléfono","phone"],["Email","email"],["Dirección","address"]].map(([l,k])=><Field key={k} label={l}><input value={company[k]||""} onChange={e=>setCompany({...company,[k]:e.target.value})}/></Field>)}</div>{error&&<div className="error">{error}</div>}<div className="modalfoot"><Btn onClick={save}>Guardar configuración</Btn></div></div></>}
function Audit(){const[rows,setRows]=useState<any[]>([]);useEffect(()=>{(async()=>{const{data}=await sb.from("audit_logs").select("*,profiles(full_name,email)").order("created_at",{ascending:false}).limit(500);setRows(data||[])})()},[]);return <><Head title="Auditoría" description="Historial técnico de operaciones y cambios."/><div className="panel"><div className="tablewrap"><table className="table"><thead><tr><th>Fecha</th><th>Usuario</th><th>Acción</th><th>Entidad</th><th>ID</th></tr></thead><tbody>{rows.map(r=><tr key={r.id}><td>{new Date(r.created_at).toLocaleString('es-PY')}</td><td>{r.profiles?.full_name||r.profiles?.email||"Sistema"}</td><td><Status>{r.action}</Status></td><td>{r.entity}</td><td><code>{r.entity_id||"—"}</code></td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></div></>}
